<body>
<main id="world" tabindex="-1" aria-label="可探索的三维数字庭院。使用 WASD 或方向键行走；靠近建筑后按回车访问。"></main>
<div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="hud" id="hud" inert>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="identity"><span class="seal" aria-hidden="true">游</span><div><div class="wordmark">Lx050</div><div class="subtitle">数字庭院 · 夜游</div></div></div>
    <nav class="districts" aria-label="前往分区">
      <button data-zone="0" title="前往作品区">作品<span>08</span></button><button data-zone="1" title="前往服务区">服务<span>05</span></button><button data-zone="2" title="前往项目区">项目<span>11</span></button><button data-zone="3" title="前往连接区">连接<span>02</span></button>
    </nav>
    <div class="tools"><button id="sky-button" type="button" title="天时流转 · 点击拨到下一时相">天时 · 夜</button><span id="bridge-count" title="七桥挑战:每桥恰走一次" aria-live="polite">七桥 0/7</span><span id="visited" title="已探访并点亮的入口" aria-live="polite">00 / 26</span><button id="home" title="返回庭心（R）">归庭</button><button id="list-button" aria-haspopup="dialog">目录 ↗</button><button id="bgm-button" type="button" aria-label="开启背景音乐" aria-pressed="false" title="开启背景音乐"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M11 4 6 8H3v8h3l5 4Z"/><g class="bgm-waves"><path d="M15 8a6 6 0 0 1 0 8M18 5a10 10 0 0 1 0 14"/></g><path class="bgm-cross" d="m16 9 6 6m0-6-6 6"/></svg></button></div>
  </header>
  <div class="margin-note" aria-hidden="true"><i></i>灯火所及，皆是来处。</div>
  <div class="viewpad" id="viewpad" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="视角控制：拖动旋转视角，聚焦后使用方向键调整，Home 重置"><span class="arrows">↔</span><small>拖动视角</small></div>
  <div class="bottom-note"><div id="location">庭心</div><div class="desktop-help"><p><kbd>W</kbd> <kbd>A</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd> / 方向键 · 行走</p><p><kbd>↵</kbd> / <kbd>空格</kbd> · 访问　拖动画面 · 环顾</p></div></div>
  <div id="joystick" aria-label="移动摇杆"><div id="stick"></div><small>拖动行走</small></div>
  <div class="mapbox"><canvas id="map" width="288" height="288" aria-label="庭院地图：朱砂色圆点为当前位置"></canvas><small>一岛 · 二十六盏灯</small></div>
  <div id="ambient-hint">提灯走近，让故事发生。</div>
  <section id="interaction" aria-label="附近的入口">
    <div class="entry-copy" aria-live="polite"><div class="eyebrow" id="entry-zone"></div><h2 id="entry-title"></h2><p id="entry-desc"></p></div>
    <a id="enter-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">访问 ↗<span>ENTER / 空格</span></a>
  </section>
  <div id="bridge-toast" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <section id="euler-card" aria-label="七桥挑战" hidden><div class="entry-copy"><div class="eyebrow">1736 · 柯尼斯堡</div><h2 id="euler-title">七桥 · 欧拉的判定</h2><p id="euler-text"></p></div><button id="euler-action">架设新桥 ↗</button></section>
</div>
<section id="intro" aria-label="进入数字庭院">
  <div class="intro-inner"><div class="intro-kicker">A SMALL ISLAND OF THOUGHTS</div><h1>Lx050<span style="color:var(--red)">.</span></h1><div class="intro-poem">在数字之间，留一点人间</div><div class="intro-line"></div><p class="intro-description">一些作品，一些故事，一些仍在生长的念头。<br>借一盏灯，随意走走。</p><button class="start" id="start" disabled>正在点灯<span class="arrow">↗</span></button><div class="intro-controls" id="intro-controls">WASD / 方向键行走 · 拖动环顾 · 回车访问<br>点击或按任意键，开始夜游</div></div>
  <div class="intro-footer"><span>作品 / 服务 / 项目 / 连接</span><span>慢一点，也没有关系。 &nbsp; © Lx050</span></div>
</section>
<section id="directory" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="directory-title" hidden><div class="directory-inner"><div class="directory-head"><h2 id="directory-title">庭院目录</h2><button id="close-directory" aria-label="关闭目录">×</button></div><p class="directory-sub">二十六个入口，也可以直接抵达。所有链接在新标签页打开。</p><div id="directory-grid" class="directory-grid"></div><div class="music-credits" id="music-credits"></div></div></section>
<div id="error" role="alert" hidden><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:400">灯还没有亮起来</h2><p id="error-message">三维场景暂时无法加载，请刷新重试。也可以从目录直接访问全部入口。</p><button id="fallback-list">打开庭院目录 ↗</button></div>
<noscript>请启用 JavaScript，来这座小岛走走。</noscript>
